OL,3,GNEWSALong period of jobs growth may
OL,4,Ahave ended, figures suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long period of jobs growth in the
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland economy may have
OL,8,Fended, new official figures suggest.
OL,10,FThe data from HMRC shows that the
OL,11,Fnumber of people on company payrolls
OL,12,Fstalled at around 819,000 between April
OL,13,Fand August.
OL,15,FThe unemployment rate increased
OL,16,Fslightly to 2.4% in July but remains
OL,17,Flow by historic standards.
OL,19,FOther figures suggest employers are
OL,20,Fbecoming more cautious, including
OL,21,Fcutting back on temporary agency
OL,22,Fworkers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
